    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Chart Advantageous Courses through Turmoil</p></blockquote><p>Cartographers are the finest navigators and scouts. With their creations, they can reveal threats, protect allies, and open portals to distant places.</p><h3>Cartographer Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.wLdAD9X3LdO1Iqlr]{Tools of the Trade}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.pMzFIYKQML3ScYwI]{Adventurer's Atlas}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.T0RggNYpaRM9OiLb]{Mapping Magic}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.th6qVYzeEkYefk4C]{Guided Precision}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.weR83fyj4AYa49fO]{Ingenious Movement}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.jkLXM5eGZBwbuGhK]{Superior Atlas}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Cartographer Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Artificer Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFaerieFire]{Faerie Fire}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGuidingBol]{Guiding Bolt}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHealingWor]{Healing Word}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLocateObje]{Locate Object}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMindSpike0]{Mind Spike}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCallLightn]{Call Lightning}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplClairvoyan]{Clairvoyance}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBanishment]{Banishment}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLocateCrea]{Locate Creature}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplScrying000]{Scrying}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplTel